# BRAIN — Mozentai Site Context

## What This Project Is

Static **Jekyll 4.3** landing page for Mozentai, deployed to **GitHub Pages** at **mozentai.com** via `.github/workflows/pages.yml` on push to `main`.

**Tagline:** CyberSec Specialists, Hackers @ Work

## Repo layout

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `_layouts/default.html` | Main layout: hero, CSS, scroll animations, includes |
| `_layouts/error.html` | 404 page layout |
| `_includes/clients.html` | Axonius-style client logo marquee |
| `_includes/certifications.html` | ISO/SOC/PCI badge grid |
| `_data/services.yml` | Auditing, Hardening |
| `_data/clients.yml` | `europe` and `united_states` client lists |
| `_data/certifications.yml` | Market certifications |
| `assets/clients/*.svg` | Client wordmark logos |
| `index.md` | Homepage entry |
| `404.md` | Custom 404 |
| `_config.yml` | Site config, `lang: en-US`, `jekyll-seo-tag` |

## Design system

```css
--bg: #0d1117;
--surface: #161b22;
--border: #21262d;
--accent: #00e5a0;
--muted: #5a6b82;
--text: #c9d1d9;
--mono: JetBrains Mono;
--sans: Inter;
```

- Dark cyber aesthetic, mint green accent
- Hero: `100dvh`, centered wordmark, "Explore" scroll hint with chevron
- Scroll reveal via `IntersectionObserver` on `.reveal` elements
- `prefers-reduced-motion` respected

## Page sections (top to bottom)

1. **Hero** — MOZENT△I wordmark, tagline
2. **Services** — Auditing (one-year certification), Hardening
3. **Clients** — infinite horizontal marquee with EU and US client logos
4. **Certifications** — ISO 27001/27017/27018/9001/27701, SOC 2, PCI DSS, NIST CSF

## Clients (marquee)

- Full-width `marquee-wrap` breaks out of `.below` container
- Duplicated track for seamless `-50%` translate loop
- Logos: grayscale/muted by default, full color on hover
- Pause animation on hover

