**Clients US:** Meridian Health Systems, Atlas Federal Solutions, Pacific Grid Energy, Keystone Financial Group

## Deploy commands

```bash
cd ~/github/mozentai
bundle exec jekyll build   # local verify
git push origin main       # triggers GitHub Pages
gh run watch $(gh run list --workflow=pages.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId --jq '.[0].databaseId')
```

## Context repo mirror

Canonical rules also live at `~/github/context/mozentai/rules/`. When updating `.cursor/rules/`, copy changes there and run `~/github/context/sync.sh`.

